  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The application fails to demonstrate that the proposal would avoid adverse impacts on the amenity of neighbouring residents due to the increased noise and disturbance from the nursery use and associated comings and goings to the site. The proposal would therefore be contrary to Local Plan policies CC2 and EQ5.",
    "Reason : 2 - The application fails to demonstrate that the proposal would not prejudice highway safety or result in excessive parking stress on the roads surrounding the development. The proposal would also not make adequate arrangements for refuse and recycling and cycle parking, failing to incorporate arrangements for waste management or promote sustainable transport. The proposed development is therefore contrary to London Plan policies T5 and Local Plan policies EC2 and EQ7."
